  description: No one knows the true origins of these Golems that are found wandering
    the ruins of Orebus. Giselle's analysis indicates that these particular tiny
    constructs harbor very potent and pure concentration of dark elemental energy.
    They have been observed to don tattered black robes and chant curses together
    in the dead of the night.
